### 4.3 Request + tool-call flow (target)

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant App as Session (app)
    participant Chat as LLM::Chat (core)
    participant Proto as Protocol adapter (CC or Responses)
    participant Conn as Connection (transport)
    participant Tool as Function (core)

    App->>Chat: ask(prompt, attachments, schema)
    Chat->>Chat: append canonical user Message (History)
    Chat->>Proto: post_session(schema, exclude_reasoning)
    Proto->>Proto: encode canonical history + tools -> body
    Proto->>Conn: POST protocol path (provider endpoint/auth)
    Conn-->>Proto: SSE or JSON response
    Proto->>Proto: decode into canonical events + Message::Response
    loop for each event
        Proto-->>App: ChatEvent (text / reasoning / tool_call_requested ...)
    end
    Proto->>Chat: append resulting Response (with Usage)
    App->>Chat: call_tools_and_setup_ask([FunctionCall])
    Chat->>Tool: run(args) for each call
    Tool-->>Chat: Reply (+ attachments)
    Chat->>Chat: append canonical tool results + attachments
    App->>Chat: re_ask()
    Chat->>Proto: post_session(...) (repeat until no tool calls)
```

